  "description": "Implement `claims.index.json` derived view with active leases. Support rebuild from JSONL log. Include schema version, generated_at timestamp, sequence number, and stale_threshold_secs.\n\n## Lease Entry Schema\n- `lease_id`, `issue_id`, `agent_id`, `worktree_id`, `branch`\n- `ttl_secs`: 0 for indefinite, >0 for finite\n- `expires_at`: RFC3339 timestamp or null (for TTL=0)\n- `last_beat`: RFC3339 timestamp (for staleness checks)\n- `stale`: boolean (derived: true if TTL=0 and now - last_beat > threshold)\n\nSee design doc section \"Claims Index JSON\".",
